75,3076,3077,3078,3079,3080,3081,3082,3083,3084,3085,3086,3087,3088,3089,3090,3091,3092,3093,3094,3095,3096,3097,3098,3099,3100,3101,3102,3103,3104,3105,3106,3107,3108,3109,3110,3111,3112,3113,3114,3115,3116,3117,3118,3119,3120,3121,3122,3123,3124,3125,3126,3127,3128,3129,3130,3131,3132,3133,3134,3135,3136,3137,3138,3139,3140,3141,3142,3143,3144,3145,3146,3147,3148,3149,3150,3151,3152,3153,3154,3155,3156]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-050-quan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-050","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-050-quan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058","text":"由是霸與譚有隙。時長公主婿衞將軍全琮子寄爲霸賓客，寄素傾邪，譚所不納。先是，譚弟承與張休俱北征壽春，全琮時爲大都督，與魏將王淩戰於芍陂，軍不利，魏兵乘勝陷沒五營將（秦兒），軍，休、承奮擊之。遂駐魏師。時琮群子緒、端亦並爲將，因敵既住，乃進擊之。淩軍用退。時論功行賞。以爲功駐敵之功大，退敵之功小。休、承並爲雜號將軍，緒、端偏裨而已。寄父子益恨，共構會譚。譚坐徙交州，幽而發憤，著《新言》仁十篇。其《知難篇》蓋以自悼傷也。見流二年，年四十二，卒於交阯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"霸","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"譚","kind":"person","person_id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"xpt_euv_2zx","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"全琮","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"寄","kind":"person","person_id":"984_9e1_5e9_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gutan-complete:line058:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"霸","kind":"person","person_id":"